-->
     <para>
     修复后端进程此前等待过同步复制时，后端退出期间的竞态条件 （Dongming Liu）
    </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [f1bf619ac] 2019-08-14 15:09:42 -0400
Branch: REL_12_STABLE Release: REL_12_0 [75b2f011f] 2019-08-14 15:09:20 -0400
