-->

    <listitem>
     <para>
      Improve <application>libpq</>'s handling of out-of-memory situations
      (Michael Paquier, Amit Kapila, Heikki Linnakangas)
     </para>
    </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Meskes <meskes@postgresql.org>
