    <listitem>
     <para>
      Guard against hard-to-reach stack overflows involving record types,
      range types, <type>json</>, <type>jsonb</>, <type>tsquery</>,
      <type>ltxtquery</> and <type>query_int</> (Noah Misch)
     </para>
    </listitem>

