-->

    <listitem>
     <para>
      Fix handling of all-zeroes pages in SP-GiST indexes (Heikki
      Linnakangas)
     </para>

     <para>
      <command>VACUUM</> attempted to recycle such pages, but did so in a
      way that wasn't crash-safe.
     </para>
    </listitem>

