Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [2e105def0] 2015-02-17 12:49:18 -0500
Branch: REL9_4_STABLE [a271c9260] 2015-02-17 12:49:18 -0500
Branch: REL9_3_STABLE [4ea2d2ddb] 2015-02-17 12:49:18 -0500
